# What is NOT published: the repository holds New_SPOT_Project.m, template/ and an empty projects/

# Retired code, old diagrams, the CAD and old data (kept locally)
archive/
# Users' projects, made by New_SPOT_Project (the folder itself is kept)
projects/*
!projects/.gitkeep
# The documentation: tutorial sources, wiki and their tools
template/documentation/
# The developers' working log
template/STATUS.md

# SPOT Console: session token, ports and simulation results (per computer)
.spot_cache/
# StreamData built by the lab console (Compile) or build_linux.sh
template/+spot/+console/output/
__pycache__/
# npm's downloads when the Documentation tab's bundles are rebuilt (webapp/tools/editor-bundle)
node_modules/
# Simulink's build and cache files (regenerated)
slprj/
*.slxc
*_ert_rtw/
*.elf
*.autosave
# Runs and figures (the console creates the folder)
Saved Data/
# The big CAD folder
designs/

